{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.nichika.tribute.gig",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "致敬演出当晚",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.nichika.tribute.gig",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.nichika.tribute.gig",
    "idolId": "nichika",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "text": "会场。两百人的站席满了。后台的走廊窄得只够一个人侧身过去。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……にちか。",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "我，唱不出来。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "会唱不出来的那种人，为什么还要站上舞台啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "为什么……要站在美琴さん旁边────",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "有件事，得跟你说。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "对面事务所来问了。想让美琴和以前的搭档，今晚一起上。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "────",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "那不就是……重新组队吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "美琴さん，想跟她一起上吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "美琴是 SHHis 的。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "にちか也是。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……！",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "SHHis 什么的，我────",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──にちか。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不是因为你是个偶像才让你上台。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是因为你是偶像，才不能让你一个人扛着走下台。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……我，会唱的。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "我会站上去。会唱。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "text": "灯暗下来。她走上台，停在美琴左边半步的位置。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……一、二────",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "听不见。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "自己的声音，听不见────",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "────ah",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……！",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "美琴さん，在唱。",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "我那段，美琴さん在唱────",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……我，听见了。",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "咚、咚────！",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……好。",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "text": "演出结束了。掌声响起来的时候，她抓着美琴的袖子，一直没有松开。"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
